**Summary of RTSP methods:**

| Method | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| OPTIONS | Query server capabilities |
| DESCRIBE | Get media description (SDP) |
| ANNOUNCE | Send session description to server |
| SETUP | Establish video/audio transport |
| PLAY | Start playback |
| PAUSE | Pause playback |
| TEARDOWN | Close session |
| GET_PARAMETER | Retrieve parameter value |
| SET_PARAMETER | Set parameter value |
| REDIRECT | Redirect client to another server |
| RECORD | Start recording |